# TEMPLATE_PATHS — ownership manifest for template updates.
#
# Each non-comment, non-blank line is a project-owned path pattern (relative to
# the repo root). Files matching these lines belong to the adopter: template
# releases never touch them, and scripts/check-template-paths.sh skips them
# when reporting what an update touches. Every other tracked file is
# template-owned: a template release may change, move or delete it, and the
# adopter merges those changes (docs/UPGRADING.md §2).
#
# This manifest is not the `src/project/` code loader of the same name
# (docs/UPGRADING.md §4) — it is the file the path-check script reads.
#
# Keep in sync with docs/UPGRADING.md §2 and docs/product/ADMISSION.md Gate 2.

apps/*/src/project/**
apps/api/alembic/project_versions/**
.env
